Input: data/inputs/input_sequence_fasta/GCA_053668395.1_ASM5366839v1_genomic.fna.gz
Input validation: 6 FASTA records; 5,011,772 bp; one chromosome and five plasmids; no non-ACGTN symbols.
Software: ResFinder 4.7.2 with BLASTN 2.16.0+.
Acquired-gene database: ResFinder d1e607b8989260c7b6a3fbce8fa3204ecfc09022 (release 2.4.0).
Point-mutation database: PointFinder 694919f59a38980204009e7ade76bf319cb7df0b (release 4.1.1), organism escherichia_coli.
Parameters: acquired identity >=0.90, acquired coverage >=0.60; point identity >=0.90, point coverage >=0.95; BLAST assembly mode; known resistance mutations only.
Result handling: retained ResFinder database gene names; duplicate catB3 entries at the same locus/accession alternatives collapsed to one determinant; formatted known amino-acid substitutions as gene (REFposALT).
Output: final_answer/resistance_determinants.tsv (9 acquired genes; 4 chromosomal point mutations).
